  "details": "These are some of the OSC features I would like to have. These are simple and can be very helpful so I wanted to put them together.\n\n- `/ping [,s]` -> `/pong ,s`\n\n- Message when quitting VRChat.\n\n- Read FPS, frame-time, and FPS limit over OSC.\n\n- Send all animator parameters upon avatar load (after `/avatar/change`) including the parameters which are in their default values (looking at you `VRMode`).\n\n(I had more ideas but they either were too much for this request or can be accomplished with these.)",
